### Check User 2 Balance (Initial)
# Should be 100,000
GET http://localhost:8080/clients/2

###

### Attempt Subscription (Insufficient Balance)
# User 2 (100,000) tries to subscribe to Fund 2 (125,000)
# Should fail with 400 Bad Request and Insufficient Balance message
POST http://localhost:8080/funds/subscribe
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientId": "2",
  "fundId": "2"
}

###

### Check User 2 Balance (After Failure)
# Should still be 100,000 (No deduction)
GET http://localhost:8080/clients/2

###

### Check Transaction History
# Should be empty or no new transaction for this attempt
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/history/2
